The final weekend to try our Treacle tart with a Whipped Crème Fraîche Ganache. 

Breadcrumbs soaked in a mixture of golden syrup, lemon, double cream and egg yolk to set the mix during the bake. It is then topped with a retro-style piped crème fraîche ganache, lemon zest and breadcrumbs, which balances both the sweetness and richness of the filling.

